WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.417 --> 00:00:00.792
Well, it

00:00:00.792 --> 00:00:01.126
is my

00:00:01.126 --> 00:00:01.626
honor to be

00:00:01.626 --> 00:00:04.004
back at the Munich Security Conference.

00:00:05.088 --> 00:00:07.257
As many of us remember

00:00:07.257 --> 00:00:09.426
last year on this stage

00:00:10.635 --> 00:00:13.722
I warned of the imminent invasion

00:00:15.015 --> 00:00:18.268
of Ukraine by Russia.

00:00:18.268 --> 00:00:20.687
And let us all recall

00:00:20.687 --> 00:00:22.814
Many at the time wondered

00:00:23.565 --> 00:00:25.859
how we would all respond.

00:00:27.027 --> 00:00:30.447
Many wondered, could Russia be stopped?

00:00:31.656 --> 00:00:33.950
Would need to come together?

00:00:35.243 --> 00:00:37.412
Would Natal break apart?

00:00:38.621 --> 00:00:40.957
And would Ukraine

00:00:40.957 --> 00:00:44.044
be prepared

00:00:44.377 --> 00:00:45.795
Colleagues

00:00:45.795 --> 00:00:48.465
today, a year later, we know

00:00:49.758 --> 00:00:52.177
he is still standing.

00:00:52.927 --> 00:00:54.596
Russia

00:01:02.979 --> 00:01:05.315
Russia is weakened.

00:01:05.315 --> 00:01:08.985
The transatlantic alliance is stronger.

00:01:09.736 --> 00:01:11.321
Than ever

00:01:18.036 --> 00:01:20.330
And most importantly,

00:01:20.330 --> 00:01:23.333
the spirit of the Ukrainian

00:01:23.333 --> 00:01:25.418
people indoors

00:01:26.836 --> 00:01:28.671
and under.

00:01:28.671 --> 00:01:31.674
Joe Biden, president of the United States

00:01:32.467 --> 00:01:34.803
Our country has demonstrated

00:01:34.803 --> 00:01:37.430
decisive leadership.

00:01:37.430 --> 00:01:39.641
As President Biden often says,

00:01:40.350 --> 00:01:42.852
the United States will support Ukraine

00:01:43.311 --> 00:01:46.189
for as long as it takes.

00:01:46.189 --> 00:01:47.398
We will not waver.

00:01:48.691 --> 00:01:50.026
And today

00:01:50.026 --> 00:01:53.196
at this Munich security conference,

00:01:53.863 --> 00:01:57.659
I will then describe what we all continue

00:01:57.951 --> 00:02:00.954
to have at stake.

00:02:00.995 --> 00:02:03.039
The moral interest,

00:02:03.039 --> 00:02:06.918
the strategic interest, and the reason

00:02:07.043 --> 00:02:09.963
Ukraine matters

00:02:09.963 --> 00:02:12.674
for the people of America.

00:02:12.674 --> 00:02:15.343
For the people of Europe

00:02:15.343 --> 00:02:17.512
and for people around the world.

00:02:19.430 --> 00:02:21.432
First, from the starting days

00:02:21.432 --> 00:02:25.603
of this unprovoked war, we have witnessed

00:02:26.271 --> 00:02:29.899
Russian forces engage in horrendous

00:02:29.899 --> 00:02:32.652
atrocities and war crimes.

00:02:33.903 --> 00:02:36.072
Their actions are an assault

00:02:36.823 --> 00:02:39.742
on our common values.

00:02:39.742 --> 00:02:43.454
An attack on our common humanity.

00:02:45.415 --> 00:02:48.001
And let us be clear.

00:02:48.001 --> 00:02:52.255
Russian forces have pursued a widespread

00:02:53.298 --> 00:02:56.217
and systemic attack

00:02:56.217 --> 00:03:00.221
against a civilian population

00:03:02.182 --> 00:03:05.101
Gruesome acts of murder,

00:03:06.060 --> 00:03:08.104
torture, rape

00:03:08.855 --> 00:03:11.316
and deportation.

00:03:11.566 --> 00:03:13.776
Execution style killings,

00:03:15.278 --> 00:03:17.155
beatings

00:03:17.405 --> 00:03:19.782
and electrocution.

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:21.826
Russian authorities

00:03:21.826 --> 00:03:25.246
have forcibly deported hundreds

00:03:25.246 --> 00:03:28.750
of thousands of people from Ukraine

00:03:29.209 --> 00:03:29.834
to Russia,

00:03:31.085 --> 00:03:33.338
including children

00:03:34.130 --> 00:03:36.341
They have cruelly separated

00:03:36.341 --> 00:03:38.885
children from their families.

00:03:41.179 --> 00:03:43.181
And we've all seen the images

00:03:44.140 --> 00:03:47.227
of the theater in Mariupol,

00:03:47.227 --> 00:03:50.230
where hundreds of people were killed

00:03:52.440 --> 00:03:54.525
Think of the image

00:03:54.525 --> 00:03:56.986
of the pregnant mother

00:03:57.195 --> 00:03:58.696
who was killed

00:03:58.696 --> 00:03:59.948
following a strike

00:03:59.948 --> 00:04:02.909
at a maternity hospital

00:04:02.909 --> 00:04:05.036
where she was preparing to give birth

00:04:07.956 --> 00:04:11.334
Think of the images of Boucher

00:04:11.834 --> 00:04:13.378
civilians shot

00:04:13.378 --> 00:04:16.547
in cold blood.

00:04:16.798 --> 00:04:19.050
Their bodies left in the street

00:04:22.345 --> 00:04:24.514
The jarring photograph of the man

00:04:24.514 --> 00:04:27.642
who was riding his bike

00:04:29.352 --> 00:04:31.062
Think of the four year

00:04:31.062 --> 00:04:32.272
old girl

00:04:34.357 --> 00:04:37.485
who the United Nations recently reported

00:04:37.652 --> 00:04:39.195
was sexually assaulted

00:04:39.195 --> 00:04:41.614
by a Russian soldier.

00:04:41.864 --> 00:04:44.826
A four year old child

00:04:48.496 --> 00:04:49.914
Barbaric

00:04:50.498 --> 00:04:53.042
and inhumane.

00:04:55.128 --> 00:04:55.837
Long before

00:04:55.837 --> 00:04:56.337
I was vice

00:04:56.337 --> 00:04:59.007
president of the United States,

00:04:59.007 --> 00:05:00.883
I spent the majority of my career as

00:05:00.883 --> 00:05:01.676
a prosecutor.

00:05:03.177 --> 00:05:04.220
Beginning as a young

00:05:04.220 --> 00:05:06.431
lawyer in the courtroom

00:05:06.431 --> 00:05:07.056
and later

00:05:07.056 --> 00:05:08.266
running the California

00:05:08.266 --> 00:05:10.685
Department of Justice,

00:05:10.852 --> 00:05:13.813
I know firsthand

00:05:13.855 --> 00:05:15.982
the importance of gathering facts

00:05:17.066 --> 00:05:19.777
and holding them up against the law.

00:05:22.113 --> 00:05:23.656
In the case

00:05:23.656 --> 00:05:26.617
of Russia's actions in Ukraine,

00:05:27.827 --> 00:05:30.413
we have examined the evidence

00:05:31.914 --> 00:05:33.416
We know

00:05:33.416 --> 00:05:37.253
the legal standards

00:05:37.545 --> 00:05:40.465
And there is no doubt

00:05:42.008 --> 00:05:43.968
these are crimes

00:05:43.968 --> 00:05:47.638
against humanity.

00:05:56.606 --> 00:05:58.066
The United States

00:05:58.066 --> 00:06:01.235
has formally determined

00:06:01.527 --> 00:06:04.697
that Russia has committed crimes

00:06:05.114 --> 00:06:08.201
against humanity.

00:06:08.534 --> 00:06:10.578
And I say

00:06:10.787 --> 00:06:11.829
to all those

00:06:11.829 --> 00:06:13.956
who have perpetrated these crimes

00:06:15.083 --> 00:06:18.169
and to their superiors

00:06:19.128 --> 00:06:22.507
who are complicit in these crimes,

00:06:23.800 --> 00:06:26.344
you will be held

00:06:27.053 --> 00:06:28.596
to account

00:06:31.599 --> 00:06:33.768
in the face of these

00:06:33.768 --> 00:06:35.978
in disputable facts.

00:06:37.355 --> 00:06:39.148
To all of us,

00:06:39.148 --> 00:06:40.942
here in Munich.

00:06:41.901 --> 00:06:44.153
Let us renew

00:06:44.153 --> 00:06:46.197
our commitment

00:06:46.197 --> 00:06:48.408
to accountability

00:06:49.117 --> 00:06:53.079
Let us renew our commitment

00:06:53.955 --> 00:06:55.123
to the rule of law.

00:06:56.958 --> 00:06:59.043
As for the United States,

00:06:59.043 --> 00:07:01.421
we will continue to support

00:07:02.296 --> 00:07:04.549
the judicial process in Ukraine

00:07:05.383 --> 00:07:07.969
and international investigations

00:07:09.345 --> 00:07:12.223
because justice must be served

00:07:14.058 --> 00:07:16.602
Let us all agree

00:07:17.019 --> 00:07:19.355
on behalf of all the victims,

00:07:19.981 --> 00:07:22.900
both known and unknown

00:07:24.485 --> 00:07:27.905
Justice must be served

00:07:28.239 --> 00:07:29.407
Such

00:07:29.949 --> 00:07:32.410
is our moral interest

00:07:34.662 --> 00:07:37.039
We also have a significant

00:07:37.623 --> 00:07:39.959
strategic interest.

00:07:40.209 --> 00:07:42.295
The fight in Ukraine

00:07:42.295 --> 00:07:45.006
has far reaching global

00:07:45.381 --> 00:07:47.467
ramifications

00:07:48.217 --> 00:07:49.635
No nation

00:07:49.635 --> 00:07:52.597
is safe in a world where one country

00:07:53.139 --> 00:07:54.432
can violate

00:07:54.432 --> 00:07:57.602
the sovereignty and territorial integrity

00:07:58.019 --> 00:07:59.228
of another

00:08:06.235 --> 00:08:08.821
Where crimes against humanity

00:08:08.821 --> 00:08:11.032
are committed with impunity.

00:08:11.949 --> 00:08:13.534
Where a country

00:08:13.534 --> 00:08:15.786
with imperialist ambitions

00:08:16.829 --> 00:08:19.207
can go unchecked.

00:08:19.290 --> 00:08:21.584
Our response to the Russian invasion

00:08:22.335 --> 00:08:25.129
is a demonstration of our collective

00:08:25.713 --> 00:08:26.923
commitment

00:08:26.923 --> 00:08:30.218
to uphold international rules and norms,

00:08:31.177 --> 00:08:34.013
rules and norms which, since the end of

00:08:34.013 --> 00:08:35.097
World War Two,

00:08:36.098 --> 00:08:37.099
have provided

00:08:37.099 --> 00:08:40.895
unprecedented security and prosperity

00:08:41.812 --> 00:08:44.315
not only for the American people,

00:08:45.107 --> 00:08:47.902
not only for the people of Europe,

00:08:49.237 --> 00:08:52.573
but people around the world.

00:08:52.573 --> 00:08:54.700
Principles that state,

00:08:55.368 --> 00:08:58.037
that sovereign nations have a right

00:08:58.412 --> 00:09:00.581
to peacefully exist,

00:09:02.041 --> 00:09:05.169
that borders must not be changed

00:09:05.169 --> 00:09:07.338
by force,

00:09:07.505 --> 00:09:10.841
that they are inalienable human rights,

00:09:12.051 --> 00:09:14.387
which governments must respect,

00:09:16.180 --> 00:09:18.391
and that the rule of law

00:09:18.391 --> 00:09:22.353
must be preserved

00:09:22.645 --> 00:09:25.147
Indeed, this moment

00:09:25.147 --> 00:09:28.359
has tested our willingness

00:09:28.943 --> 00:09:31.153
to defend and uphold

00:09:31.654 --> 00:09:34.782
these rules and norms,

00:09:34.782 --> 00:09:37.618
and we have remained strong

00:09:38.828 --> 00:09:42.456
and we must stay strong

00:09:43.916 --> 00:09:46.085
because if Putin were to succeed

00:09:46.586 --> 00:09:48.379
with his attack

00:09:48.379 --> 00:09:50.464
on these fundamental principles,

00:09:52.425 --> 00:09:54.385
other nations

00:09:54.385 --> 00:09:56.804
could feel emboldened

00:09:56.804 --> 00:09:59.473
to follow his violent example

00:10:01.267 --> 00:10:03.728
Other authoritarian powers

00:10:04.478 --> 00:10:05.771
could seek

00:10:05.771 --> 00:10:08.441
to bend the world to their will

00:10:09.859 --> 00:10:11.652
through coercion.

00:10:11.652 --> 00:10:15.489
Disinformation, and even brute force.

00:10:17.116 --> 00:10:18.576
The international order

00:10:18.576 --> 00:10:21.495
upon which we all rely

00:10:22.246 --> 00:10:24.457
could be at risk

00:10:25.207 --> 00:10:27.001
So in the interest

00:10:27.001 --> 00:10:29.754
of global security and prosperity,

00:10:30.713 --> 00:10:32.965
one of our defining missions

00:10:34.008 --> 00:10:36.177
is to uphold

00:10:36.177 --> 00:10:38.804
international rules based order.

00:10:39.430 --> 00:10:42.933
And nations around the world agree

00:10:44.226 --> 00:10:48.105
Consider more than 140 countries

00:10:48.564 --> 00:10:51.776
voted at the United Nations to condemn

00:10:52.526 --> 00:10:55.946
Russia's aggression and to support

00:10:56.405 --> 00:10:57.281
Ukraine's

00:10:57.281 --> 00:10:59.575
sovereignty and territorial integrity.

00:11:00.576 --> 00:11:02.203
In defense

00:11:02.203 --> 00:11:04.622
of the core principles of the U.N.

00:11:04.622 --> 00:11:05.623
Charter.

00:11:06.791 --> 00:11:09.377
Of course, we have also seen

00:11:10.127 --> 00:11:12.797
nations like North Korea and Iran

00:11:14.256 --> 00:11:16.300
send weapons in support

00:11:17.009 --> 00:11:20.346
of Russia's brutal war.

00:11:20.346 --> 00:11:23.974
We are also troubled that Beijing

00:11:25.101 --> 00:11:27.978
has deepened its relationship with Moscow

00:11:28.521 --> 00:11:31.232
since the war began.

00:11:31.691 --> 00:11:33.526
Looking ahead,

00:11:33.818 --> 00:11:36.487
any steps by China

00:11:36.487 --> 00:11:39.490
to provide lethal support to Russia

00:11:40.991 --> 00:11:43.703
would only reward aggression,

00:11:45.162 --> 00:11:47.623
continue the killing,

00:11:47.623 --> 00:11:51.210
and further undermine a rules based order

00:11:53.713 --> 00:11:55.673
Again, the United States

00:11:55.673 --> 00:11:56.716
will continue

00:11:56.716 --> 00:11:59.593
to strongly support Ukraine,

00:11:59.593 --> 00:12:01.929
and we will do so for

00:12:01.929 --> 00:12:04.682
as long as it takes

00:12:06.517 --> 00:12:07.601
the American people.

00:12:07.601 --> 00:12:08.602
You see

00:12:10.271 --> 00:12:11.689
in all

00:12:12.398 --> 00:12:15.609
of the resolve of the people of Ukraine,

00:12:17.236 --> 00:12:20.364
in all of their resilience

00:12:20.364 --> 00:12:22.658
and righteousness

00:12:22.867 --> 00:12:25.661
their willingness to fight

00:12:26.412 --> 00:12:30.124
for freedom and liberty,

00:12:30.124 --> 00:12:32.251
and the extraordinary tenacity

00:12:32.251 --> 00:12:34.754
and leadership of President Zelensky.

00:12:36.505 --> 00:12:38.507
In fact, joining me in Munich

00:12:38.841 --> 00:12:40.968
are distinguished members

00:12:40.968 --> 00:12:44.013
of the United States Congress,

00:12:44.013 --> 00:12:47.433
Republicans and Democrats, members

00:12:47.433 --> 00:12:49.518
of the House of Representatives

00:12:49.518 --> 00:12:52.396
and the United States Senate.

00:12:52.438 --> 00:12:55.065
And they are here together

00:12:55.065 --> 00:12:57.902
because they understand the stakes.

00:12:59.153 --> 00:13:01.405
The leadership of these members

00:13:01.405 --> 00:13:02.990
has been vital

00:13:02.990 --> 00:13:05.117
to America's support of Ukraine.

00:13:06.202 --> 00:13:07.369
And President Biden

00:13:07.369 --> 00:13:10.873
and I know that their support for Ukraine

00:13:11.165 --> 00:13:12.917
will continue.

00:13:14.001 --> 00:13:16.754
We also know

00:13:16.754 --> 00:13:19.465
Ukraine will continue to be supported

00:13:19.465 --> 00:13:23.260
by a United Transatlantic community

00:13:33.437 --> 00:13:35.856
so that he could divide.

00:13:37.733 --> 00:13:40.736
Remember where we were a year ago

00:13:40.736 --> 00:13:43.781
In this, he has failed.

00:13:43.781 --> 00:13:46.075
The NATO alliance is stronger

00:13:46.075 --> 00:13:49.119
now than ever before.

00:13:49.119 --> 00:13:51.080
And the United States commitment

00:13:51.080 --> 00:13:52.456
to NATO's

00:13:52.957 --> 00:13:55.960
and to its Article five is ironclad.

00:13:57.169 --> 00:13:59.547
Just look at our track record

00:13:59.547 --> 00:14:01.757
over the past year.

00:14:01.757 --> 00:14:02.925
Just look

00:14:02.925 --> 00:14:05.302
at our multilateral cooperation.

00:14:06.470 --> 00:14:08.472
Together, we have provided

00:14:08.472 --> 00:14:11.141
historic assistance to Ukraine.

00:14:12.560 --> 00:14:14.603
Together, we have dealt

00:14:15.187 --> 00:14:17.606
Russia a strategic failure.

00:14:19.233 --> 00:14:21.277
Together, we have imposed

00:14:21.610 --> 00:14:24.530
unprecedented costs on Russia.

00:14:26.240 --> 00:14:27.658
And together,

00:14:27.658 --> 00:14:30.286
we have pursued energy security

00:14:30.536 --> 00:14:33.831
and reinvested in our collective defense.

00:14:34.623 --> 00:14:37.209
And we have come together

00:14:37.209 --> 00:14:39.545
to stand for our common values

00:14:40.421 --> 00:14:43.424
and our common interests

00:14:43.424 --> 00:14:46.677
and our common humanity.

00:14:48.637 --> 00:14:50.222
I have no doubt

00:14:50.222 --> 00:14:52.349
that this unity will endure.

00:14:54.351 --> 00:14:56.478
I also have no illusions

00:14:56.478 --> 00:14:57.771
about the path forward

00:14:59.648 --> 00:15:00.149
There will

00:15:00.149 --> 00:15:02.526
be more dark days in Ukraine.

00:15:04.111 --> 00:15:07.448
The daily agony of war will persist.

00:15:08.949 --> 00:15:10.993
The global ripple effects

00:15:11.410 --> 00:15:13.621
will continue to be felt

00:15:13.621 --> 00:15:16.665
by countries near and far from Africa

00:15:17.416 --> 00:15:19.251
to Southeast Asia.

00:15:19.251 --> 00:15:21.128
To the Caribbean.

00:15:21.921 --> 00:15:24.548
But if Putin thinks he can wait us out,

00:15:25.090 --> 00:15:27.760
he is badly mistaken.

00:15:27.760 --> 00:15:30.554
Time is not on his side.

00:15:31.722 --> 00:15:33.599
To be sure,

00:15:33.599 --> 00:15:36.143
Ukrainians will continue

00:15:36.143 --> 00:15:38.771
to be tried and tested

00:15:38.771 --> 00:15:40.773
just as they have been over this past

00:15:40.773 --> 00:15:41.649
year.

00:15:42.524 --> 00:15:44.985
Transatlantic unity

00:15:44.985 --> 00:15:48.030
will continue to be tried and tested

00:15:49.239 --> 00:15:51.700
and I am certain that Ukraine

00:15:51.867 --> 00:15:54.703
will rise to the task

00:15:54.703 --> 00:15:56.705
that the United States and Europe

00:15:57.373 --> 00:16:00.918
will rise to the task

00:16:01.251 --> 00:16:03.796
So my last point

00:16:04.505 --> 00:16:06.674
America will continue our leadership

00:16:07.466 --> 00:16:10.177
in defense of human dignity,

00:16:11.679 --> 00:16:14.348
in defense of rules and norms

00:16:15.307 --> 00:16:19.186
and in defense of freedom and liberty.

00:16:20.813 --> 00:16:21.230
There is

00:16:21.230 --> 00:16:24.400
too much at stake

00:16:24.400 --> 00:16:26.860
to do anything less.

00:16:27.319 --> 00:16:29.738
Americans know well

00:16:29.738 --> 00:16:32.741
the meaning of independence.

00:16:32.783 --> 00:16:35.619
We believe in the fundamental importance

00:16:36.286 --> 00:16:38.288
of sovereignty and rule of law.

00:16:39.456 --> 00:16:41.542
And we will always stand

00:16:41.542 --> 00:16:45.337
on the side of justice.

00:16:45.921 --> 00:16:47.381
Colleagues,

00:16:48.465 --> 00:16:51.385
I do believe we all know

00:16:51.385 --> 00:16:53.804
when future generations

00:16:53.804 --> 00:16:57.516
look back at this moment,

00:16:57.558 --> 00:16:59.560
they will see

00:17:00.185 --> 00:17:02.730
that we understood

00:17:02.730 --> 00:17:05.733
the task before us

00:17:05.733 --> 00:17:08.485
and Rose to this occasion

00:17:10.863 --> 00:17:13.073
And so to you, I say

00:17:13.073 --> 00:17:16.243
the United States of America is proud

00:17:17.202 --> 00:17:21.040
to be your partner in this noble pursuit.

00:17:21.373 --> 00:17:22.332
Thank you.

00:17:45.981 --> 00:17:47.399
Thank you.

00:17:47.399 --> 00:17:48.317
Wonderful.

00:17:48.317 --> 00:17:49.151
We got

00:17:58.202 --> 00:17:59.578
and the vice president.

00:17:59.578 --> 00:18:01.038
Thank you for this very,

00:18:01.038 --> 00:18:02.414
very strong speech,

00:18:02.414 --> 00:18:05.209
this commitment to transatlantic unity

00:18:05.209 --> 00:18:07.294
this commitment to the support

00:18:07.377 --> 00:18:08.378
of Ukraine.

00:18:08.378 --> 00:18:10.756
And we have many, many representatives

00:18:10.756 --> 00:18:12.382
from Ukraine here in the room.

00:18:12.382 --> 00:18:13.842
And they

00:18:13.842 --> 00:18:16.011
certainly were reassured by what you

00:18:16.011 --> 00:18:18.305
have said. Let me ask you

00:18:20.474 --> 00:18:22.392
you confirmed this U.S.

00:18:22.392 --> 00:18:25.479
support, but we all know next year

00:18:25.479 --> 00:18:26.772
the United States will enter

00:18:26.772 --> 00:18:28.982
into an election campaign

00:18:28.982 --> 00:18:31.110
and we are in a democracy.

00:18:32.152 --> 00:18:34.655
We know which side of the aisle

00:18:35.531 --> 00:18:37.699
the result will be.

00:18:37.699 --> 00:18:41.328
How sure are you that certain?

00:18:41.328 --> 00:18:43.956
Are you that what you have said, that

00:18:43.956 --> 00:18:45.999
Putin, who wants to wait us out.

00:18:46.500 --> 00:18:50.337
That in the end he will not succeed

00:18:50.379 --> 00:18:52.005
Thank you, Christoph.

00:18:53.590 --> 00:18:55.425
As I said,

00:18:57.177 --> 00:18:57.970
I believe

00:18:57.970 --> 00:19:00.973
and I believe the American people

00:19:00.973 --> 00:19:03.600
understand the stakes

00:19:03.600 --> 00:19:06.145
and the stakes being

00:19:06.145 --> 00:19:07.688
our moral interest

00:19:07.688 --> 00:19:10.649
and our strategic interest.

00:19:11.108 --> 00:19:13.193
I will tell you, I travel around

00:19:13.193 --> 00:19:16.655
the United States and I have seen

00:19:17.865 --> 00:19:21.118
the Ukrainian flag fly in places

00:19:21.118 --> 00:19:22.327
most of you

00:19:22.327 --> 00:19:23.912
have probably never heard of

00:19:23.912 --> 00:19:25.998
in the United States.

00:19:26.707 --> 00:19:27.916
And storefronts

00:19:30.252 --> 00:19:32.337
in front of homes,

00:19:32.337 --> 00:19:33.255
people proudly

00:19:33.255 --> 00:19:34.840
wearing, Americans proudly

00:19:34.840 --> 00:19:37.509
wearing the colors of Ukraine,

00:19:38.802 --> 00:19:41.180
The American people

00:19:41.180 --> 00:19:44.349
are aware of the images of Bush.

00:19:46.059 --> 00:19:48.520
The American people take great pride

00:19:49.605 --> 00:19:51.940
in a fight for independence.

00:19:53.108 --> 00:19:55.903
That being part of the foundation of

00:19:55.903 --> 00:19:57.446
our nation.

00:19:57.487 --> 00:20:00.282
And and our principles and values.

00:20:01.158 --> 00:20:03.785
I think about where the United States

00:20:03.785 --> 00:20:07.623
is going on this issue based on the track

00:20:07.623 --> 00:20:10.375
record of where we've been.

00:20:10.918 --> 00:20:13.086
You only have to look at where we were a

00:20:13.086 --> 00:20:13.670
year ago

00:20:13.670 --> 00:20:14.880
and where we are today

00:20:14.880 --> 00:20:17.257
in terms of the contributions

00:20:17.257 --> 00:20:18.383
and resources

00:20:18.383 --> 00:20:20.594
that America has put into

00:20:20.594 --> 00:20:22.346
everything from ammunition

00:20:22.346 --> 00:20:24.556
to artillery to air defense,

00:20:25.474 --> 00:20:28.894
from Stingers, to to Abrams tanks,

00:20:29.686 --> 00:20:32.189
high Mar's javelins.

00:20:33.398 --> 00:20:35.525
I look at it in the context of

00:20:36.026 --> 00:20:37.527
the United States Congress,

00:20:37.527 --> 00:20:39.821
which is here in force.

00:20:39.821 --> 00:20:43.033
I'm told it is the largest delegation,

00:20:43.242 --> 00:20:45.410
bipartisan, bicameral

00:20:45.410 --> 00:20:47.621
of the United States Congress

00:20:47.621 --> 00:20:49.331
to this meeting, to this

00:20:49.331 --> 00:20:50.707
Munich Security Conference,

00:20:57.339 --> 00:20:57.756
and how

00:20:57.756 --> 00:20:58.840
forward the United

00:20:58.840 --> 00:21:01.009
States Congress in a bipartisan way

00:21:01.843 --> 00:21:02.761
has been in terms

00:21:02.761 --> 00:21:04.346
of the track record of our support

00:21:04.346 --> 00:21:05.931
just over the last year.

00:21:05.931 --> 00:21:08.684
Not to mention in a it's a technical term

00:21:08.684 --> 00:21:09.726
called an omnibus

00:21:09.726 --> 00:21:11.937
in our budgetary processes.

00:21:12.312 --> 00:21:13.647
But at the end of last year,

00:21:13.647 --> 00:21:16.358
dedicating another $45 billion

00:21:16.650 --> 00:21:18.986
for this upcoming year

00:21:18.986 --> 00:21:21.446
to support Ukraine

00:21:22.656 --> 00:21:24.700
Our priority is to ensure

00:21:25.367 --> 00:21:27.577
Ukraine's strength on the battlefield.

00:21:28.870 --> 00:21:30.539
And that is our commitment.

00:21:30.539 --> 00:21:31.623
And it is a commitment

00:21:31.623 --> 00:21:33.250
not only to the people of Ukraine,

00:21:33.250 --> 00:21:36.128
but it is a commitment to our values

00:21:36.128 --> 00:21:37.004
and the principles

00:21:37.004 --> 00:21:39.548
we hold dear as a nation.

00:21:39.548 --> 00:21:41.341
And I cannot be here

00:21:41.341 --> 00:21:43.218
without also mentioning

00:21:43.218 --> 00:21:46.013
the importance of the alliance, Europe

00:21:46.513 --> 00:21:47.431
and what it has done.

00:21:47.431 --> 00:21:48.765
Our host, Germany.

00:21:48.765 --> 00:21:51.476
I was with Chancellor Schultz yesterday.

00:21:52.477 --> 00:21:55.147
What we collectively have done.

00:21:55.147 --> 00:21:56.690
We are not only joined,

00:21:56.690 --> 00:21:58.066
I think, by our values

00:21:58.066 --> 00:22:00.277
and our understanding of the stakes

00:22:00.277 --> 00:22:01.778
and what is at stake

00:22:01.778 --> 00:22:02.654
in terms of a moral

00:22:02.654 --> 00:22:04.489
and a strategic interest.

00:22:04.489 --> 00:22:06.700
We have been great colleagues

00:22:06.700 --> 00:22:08.827
in terms of pooling our resources,

00:22:09.536 --> 00:22:11.455
coordinating our resources,

00:22:11.455 --> 00:22:11.955
in a way

00:22:11.955 --> 00:22:12.748
that I believe

00:22:12.748 --> 00:22:15.083
will give Ukraine the best support

00:22:15.083 --> 00:22:16.626
they need to fight this fight.

